Cell["A success requires every expected check to run and pass, and both result files to be exported successfully. The v5 filename/context is a stable unit ID; active code release is v6. Finite matrix-order tests and coordinate samples are explicitly distinguished from symbolic identities; the geometric, singular-set, spectral-domain and all-orders arguments remain in the paper.", "Text"]
